Build a file search system to search files on attributes of file like size, filename, type, owner.
System can contains files as well as directories.
Search all files in a particular given directory.
The system should support different search commands depending on the attribute

   - like size > 10, size = 10, size < 10
   - like filename matches regex pattern
   - like filetype = video

Enhancements
    - The system should support complex search or combined search commands as well.
    - like size > 10 AND filename matches regex-pattern AND type = video
    - like (size = 10 AND filename matches regex-pattern) OR (size = 20 AND type video) OR (type not video)